  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b6c58a671e5c534580b9151",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近正流行把前奏用在\\n影音短片上哟～其实……\\n真机伶就是那个引起流行的人哟♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "767170e94cf525b1b52c64b0fe37d58dd39f273cffd9126c285868dd3de8d326",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "87"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48fb841462c835e8793c7917",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "姐姐要听哪一首──？\\n真机伶喜欢可爱的歌～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "28e67f376699fcbfc1e769bf90c87d5bf40dcc33e714d9e3e21480bf02909df4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "88"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:859e25ac88e515c422b8af86",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哥哥要听哪一首──？\\n真机伶喜欢可爱的歌～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d20b703e0c7bcbbcff3d4e9ba95ef4db203f8de0d822fab89779179de761d0c5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "89"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c81a37830c9824a84ffcb78b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "欸欸～要选哪首歌好呢？\\n我现在要来发表帝王大人的\\n华丽舞步啰♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "83c7cdee2197bc168a891e4d25c3fc5a04b8743ceadef5267609b400eee553ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd3616ee459a4afbd171d9d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「即使要与世界为敌」……\\n不管听几次都觉得好帅♪\\n简直就是最适合公主与王子的歌曲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad99d885cec32e0f1c3f9639769a48dab05fd718298b675604d1745960dbf178",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "90"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed5f33d180fccd48a0868aa6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一听见这首歌……就想起\\n下定决心要成为公主的那一天……\\n对我而言那就是「最初的一小步」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5b00f0ecfa95d66e554d6d298719c16fbc10cd1465af23bb6a91e119b65b967",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "91"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7dc952ef2219058a361a881",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀，好棒的歌曲！\\n情绪整个嗨起来咯～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "761a8b881706f21ab01312d3b64189ac778ad7b8ce49a7b7208aa147f779d067",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "92"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:938ab25003407250fffe1a9f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我觉得轻快的歌词啦旋律啦\\n是都很棒……但要摆动尾巴这点\\n该说是会有点难为情吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f16adc08ccd6db1b440d0e553c6e2a5d2634973264b359319ea7d407e7ffa74",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "93"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1dcd12247d2b44802e6054a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哦～这样就能知道你的喜好啊。\\n所以说，你喜欢哪种？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf73b5fcf98f4c1ecde61f044fcec9ada800b372caf7d2886872c264b6443262",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "94"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc43b6ed47237a8261220d00",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "闪耀！率直！发光！\\n……怎么样！？我试着用班长作风\\n表达出这首歌的感动之处了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11d6b473989023df394160e758735ad55ae48fdaac60d2c0ec95e964e48c8577",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "95"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88294818247c5e522fcb0522",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员也一起来！\\n爆进爆进爆进！\\n很好！以894次为目标，再做一遍！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5349c957223b2266d31e591593315bf33f0d6473a224508f8a90025f0324d454",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "96"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56601adc9444d6b26e7777a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "演唱会的预习和复习也不该偷懒！\\n音乐预备……爆进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc995420058486804300d5a04a8ef02112122786594b11b0320dbea18884b49d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "97"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:784bb8acdd9f3a496ae6bded",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只要有训练员在身旁，\\n不管是什么情况我都能跑。\\n我就来证明这点给你看吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cb3023789e487aff4be2e0ad79337be7aaacec7e6d4090704537d5948a55925",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "98"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8162b9ca10720fe7e7c6c537",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "来吧，现在是音乐时间喔～♪\\n训练员喜欢的歌曲\\n是哪一首呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a633d51944eb309695453135c93e4279409ed682278ca5da48cee44636f4693d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "99"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d18269ab3a80e429f72abe55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<character_name>\\n以<bashin>称霸",
